: true, \\\"raison\\\": \\\"explication courte\\\"}\\nou\\n{\\\"accord\\\": false, \\\"raison\\\": \\\"explication courte\\\"}\\n\"],\"options\":{\"base_url\":\"https://ollama.com\",\"model\":\"gpt-oss:120b\",\"temperature\":0,\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer c2e3e947850940538dca18ce9de53405.nVfbN2aAcpBhILCdyFgwlbJi\"}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"We need to determine if this thread is an onboarding email where client expresses willingness to work with the cabinet. The thread appears to be an email chain forwarded to onboarding.cabinet@gmail.com. The original is between Zied Elarbi (Colead finance) and Marion Rousset (Marthe Studio). Marion is expressing her acceptance: \\\"Merci beaucoup... votre proposition me convient parfaitement... J'attends ta lettre de mission pour enclencher les premières démarches.\\\" She also provides info. So she is intending to start collaboration with Colead finance. However the recipient is onboarding.cabinet@gmail.com (maybe our cabinet). But the email is forwarded to us, with multiple forwards. The actual client is Marion (prospect) who wants to work with the cabinet \\\"Colead finance\\\". The question: Are we evaluating if the client (the email sender) expresses willingness to work with \\\"the cabinet\\\" (i.e., our cabinet). The thread is forwarded to onboarding.cabinet, but the original is about a proposal from Colead finance (the cabinet). So the client (Marion) expresses willingness to collaborate with Colead finance. That qualifies as onboarding: a new client wanting to start collaboration. So accord = true.\\n\\nBut let's double-check: The email sender of the most recent messages is Eya Jallouli forwarding the thread to onboarding@cabinet. However the core content is Marion's acceptance. The question: \\\"Le client exprime-t-il une volonté de travailler avec le cabinet (demande de prise en charge, de transfert de dossier, ou de collaboration) ?\\\" The client is Marion, she expresses desire. So yes.\\n\\nThus answer JSON with accord true and a short reason.{\\\"accord\\\": true, \\\"raison\\\": \\\"Marion confirme accepter la proposition et demande la lettre de mission, indiquant clairement son intention de commencer la collaboration avec le cabinet.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":377,\"promptTokens\":2358,\"totalTokens\":2735}}}"}}
