rtie sera facturée annuellement au moment de l'établissement de l'assemblée générale.\\r\\n\\r\\nDans l'attente de te lire,\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nBien à toi,\\r\\n\\r\\nZied\\r\\n\\r\\n[Colead finance]\\r\\nZied EL ARBI.\\r\\nAssocié\\r\\nExpert-comptable\\r\\nCommissaire aux comptes\\r\\n📞      +33 6 58 45 54 48<tel:+33658455448>  /  +33 1 45 62 46 07<tel:+33145624607>\\r\\n✉️      z.elarbi@coleadfinance.com<mailto:z.elarbi@coleadfinance.com>\\r\\n📍      67 rue de Tocqueville 75017 Paris\\r\\n\\n\\nRéponds UNIQUEMENT avec ce JSON sans markdown ni backticks :\\n{\\\"accord\\\": true, \\\"raison\\\": \\\"explication courte\\\"}\\nou\\n{\\\"accord\\\": false, \\\"raison\\\": \\\"explication courte\\\"}\\n\"],\"options\":{\"base_url\":\"https://ollama.com\",\"model\":\"gpt-oss:120b\",\"temperature\":0,\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer c2e3e947850940538dca18ce9de53405.nVfbN2aAcpBhILCdyFgwlbJi\"}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"We need to determine if the thread is an onboarding request. The thread shows Eya Jallouli forwarding emails to onboarding.cabinet@gmail.com. The content includes a chain of emails about \\\"Colead finance - Proposition d'accompagnement Marthe studio\\\". The core exchange is between Zied Elarbi (Colead finance) and Marion Rousset (Marthe Studio) discussing proposal, acceptance, asking for mission letter, etc. Marion expressed intention to work with Colead finance. However the email is being forwarded to onboarding.cabinet@gmail.com, perhaps the cabinet is Colead finance? The onboarding email thread is being sent to the onboarding address, possibly by Eya Jallouli (maybe a contact). The question: does the client express a willingness to work with the cabinet? The client is likely Marion (the prospective client). In the email chain, Marion says \\\"Merci beaucoup pour ton temps hier, ... ta proposition me convient parfaitement... J'attends ta lettre de mission pour enclencher les premières démarches.\\\" That's a clear i